  "historyNote": "#4593, eff 4-1-89; EXPIRED: 4-1-95 New. #6569, eff 8-22-97; ss by #8406, eff 8-22-05; ss by #10397, INTERIM, eff 8-22-13, EXPIRES: 2-18-14; ss by #10493, eff 2-18-14; ss by #14040, eff 8-1-24",
